  "body": "Set in the iconic Garden Court, this spacious two-bedroom apartment offers a rare combination of peace, position, and potential in one of Auckland’s most desirable beachfront locations.\r\n\r\nWith north-west and north-east ocean views, enjoy beautiful sunrises and sunsets just moments from the beach, while still benefiting from a quiet, sheltered setting.\r\n\r\nA motivated vendor means this is an outstanding opportunity to secure real value in tightly held Mission Bay. Whether you’re looking to move in, renovate and add value, or invest, the possibilities here are endless.\r\n\r\nThis classic building delivers timeless charm alongside unbeatable convenience—stroll to cafés, the Mission Bay promenade, or simply relax and take in the fresh sea air.\r\n\r\nAn affordable entry into a premium seaside address, with scope to make it your own.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
